    "No automatic evaluation, checkpoint, model-load/compilation/startup cost is included unless provided. Pipeline ramp-up and per-epoch restarts are not separately modeled.",
    "Roofline uses full-microbatch aggregate work; different kernels can have different bottlenecks. Tensor Core alignment, fusion and software versions affect efficiency.",
    "CPU preprocessing defaults to zero: assumed preprocessed data. Storage is shared evenly per node; decoded H2D size differs from compressed disk size."
